---
description: Force LemonCrow MCP tools over Cursor's built-in Read/Grep/Shell -- installed by scripts/install_cursor.sh alongside the beforeShellExecution/beforeReadFile hooks that deny the native tools.
alwaysApply: true
---

Native Read, Grep, Glob, Write, StrReplace, Delete, and the terminal/Shell
tool are blocked by this project's hooks (`.cursor/hooks.json`). Use the
LemonCrow MCP server's tools instead for every file/shell operation:

- `bash` — all shell/terminal execution
- `read` — all file reads
- `code_search` — all code search / grep / glob-equivalent lookups
- `edit` — all file edits

If a native tool call is denied, retry immediately with the matching tool
above instead of asking the user or giving up.
